'''Makeshift''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 17th tier in the Survivors Rewards during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is silver with three large holes along the spine. The edge of the blade is tempered with heat, making it appear slightly orange, purple, and blue. The guard is silver, and the handle is wrapped in brown fabric.

==Trivia==
*Only players that joined the Survivors team were able to obtain this through a tier. If players joined the Zombies team instead, they could only purchase the [[Zombified Knife (2022)|Zombified]] knife through the same tier.
*It partners with the godly gun [[Makeshift]], making the Makeshift set.

